    "event_type": "token",
    "payload": {
     "delta": "\nNow I can see the issue! The problem is in the `inc` method:\n\n```rust\npub fn inc(&self) { self.value.lock().unwrap() += 1; }\n```\n\nThe issue is that `self.value.lock().unwrap()` returns a `MutexGuard<i32>`, and the `+= 1` operation is not atomic on the `MutexGuard`. We need to dereference it first to get the `i32` value, then perform the increment operation.\n\nLet me fix this:\n",
     "type": "token"
